{"server":"tw","storyId":"act20side_level_act20side_04_beg","groupId":"act20side","stageId":"act20side_04","title":"“大水坑”","storyCode":"IC-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7194d0c74a576b856184fc0c69aa89f5a2eb2090ee68d98d839ca000c8d99afb","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g1_durinstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搓手的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽說了嗎？那個勁爆的消息！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心癢的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搓手的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克羅綺說代表們正在商量著搞出點新東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心癢的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次那個讓全城燈光變成綠色的計畫我可不太喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搓手的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是那個！是關於滑梯的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搓手的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說斯第奇和卡奇正在吵“大水坑”的改建方案呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心癢的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們兩個嗎？！已經吵到哪一步了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搓手的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好像是用水炮把人打進另一個水炮，再打進另一個......之類的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g2_fountainlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我再換個方案，用水炮把人打上高處的跳板......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你除了水炮就說不出別的了是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你給我的啟發！那麼大建築設計師斯第奇又有什麼好點子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我本來只是打算作為總建築設計師，稍微把控一下那些阿卡胡拉人的方案的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓地上人來幫忙造鐵路橋，我沒意見。但我們現在討論的，是在鐵路橋之上的，與鐵路橋共生的，際崖城的地標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不同意我碰穹頂，可以，我完全理解你對穹頂的感情，那我們就討論大滑梯之後的下一個地標是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們完全可以更簡潔優美地處理這個問題，它可以充滿象徵性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以更刺激！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以更刺激地充滿象徵性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，卡奇，我們在這裡爭不出什麼東西。要比設計搞競標？完全可以，我們給彼此留出創作時間，然後讓際崖城的市民做選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，就和當年一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也贊同——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克羅綺小姐？你這是喝酒了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事啦，就喝了一點點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"喝了三桶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，你的方案我聽說了，我很有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然卡奇也不太反對，那事情就好辦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要再找到黛柯綺，我們就能推著際崖城搞出點新東西啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，我該換一種方式對待它們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得它們很可愛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"這些小傢伙們的確還遠不能被稱作是“人”，我並不是醫生，但就算如此，我也知道人的複雜度是現在的機器還難以企及的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但這並不妨礙我們更加友善地和它們相處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"黛柯綺，你是這些小傢伙的“家長”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......家長，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"這些小傢伙願意依賴你，願意相信你，就像剛剛破殼的羽獸在媽媽的翅膀下成長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很長時間，我看待它們的態度......沒有那麼“關心”。我只是在做一個工業代表該做的，和一代代的工業代表沒什麼不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機器人的管理員們從那些喜歡泡在圖書館機械區裡的杜林人中選拔而出，我們得掌握製造這些小東西的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實並不複雜，只要按照書上說的去做，把自己喜歡的零件裝在一起......發揮自己的想像力，它們總能動起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的老師曾經花費了很多年想要搞清楚這些小傢伙運轉的原理，不過最後毫無收獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說老師的老師也研究過，她成功讓助理機器人可以講笑話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道該怎麼激怒一個杜林人嗎？沒人知道！哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，水準很高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，我只是理所當然地借助它們的力量。祖瑪瑪，你說得對，我應該試著和它們“交流”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"0429，你的同伴0428已經退役，它無法透過檢修被喚醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它仍是我們的一員，它建設過的東西不會消亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退役不是終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本機確認指令，退役不是終點。明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪定義了關係，朋友。黛柯綺，希望和你定義為朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，是啊，朋友，我們還可以擁有這種關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"0429，你知道嗎？朋友之間就是會互幫互助的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我嫌麻煩的事情，我總是命令你們代我去做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，這並不好。我們之間應該有更平等的相處模式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，我會以朋友的身份拜託你們幫忙去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到，幫助朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"0429，拜託你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送三大箱麥酒去我家裡，再帶些零食。然後幫我跟耶奇大師說一聲，我在睡覺，今天的代表例會就不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不太對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祖瑪瑪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘉維爾，你們來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的新朋友助理機器人0429和它的無良老闆黛柯綺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黛柯綺，會議邀請，全體代表——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"0429，任務變更，我依然以朋友的身份拜託你，幫個小忙，你去代我喊個到吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的機械0429","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫助朋友，幫助朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g7_durinhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，我們上次這麼多人一起開會是為了什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了酒類供應不足的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有不足過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個會你翹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，真是懷念啊，喜歡蜜釀的人為了不讓烈酒愛好者喝到酒，買空了際崖城的烈酒存貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了報復，烈酒愛好者協會的人也在城裡大肆收購蜜釀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幫醉鬼喝不到酒活得下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活不下去。於是他們開始喝本來只是為了報復仇家才囤的酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說那段時間，兩邊愛好者協會的會員對調了不少，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，他們還是不能理解漿果番茄酒的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇，你......你是喝漿果番茄酒的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得各種酒類愛好者協會都沒有你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......算了，關於讓我們聚在這裡的“大水坑”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意拆除“大水坑”。越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是還挺喜歡那裡的嘛！克羅綺，你每周都會去好幾次呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我後悔了，居然在喜歡漿果番茄酒的傢伙建的設施裡浪費了那麼多時間......恥辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"參與了這種人的項目......這是我作為工業代表的失職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個！喂，耶奇大師，你那是什麼表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，喜歡漿果番茄酒，確實有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然諸位達成了共識，我們就號召大家把那個花裡胡哨的大滑梯炸掉，重新修通鐵路，解決耶奇大師擔心的問題，就這樣，沒意見吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有點可惜，不過建築設計師不會讓過去的作品困住自己的。這是新的大展拳腳的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，你之前說你會和卡奇競標際崖城的新地標，這話是認真的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？斯第奇，你終於又要出手了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都說到這個份上了，我當然要拿出點真本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來接下來幾個月要精彩了啊，我得先囤點酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，耶奇大師，要不要試試漿果番茄酒，真的沒那麼糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計票——結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，按照大家的決議，“大水坑”的生命周期會就此完結。我們會重新修建鐵路橋，並將同時建設新的際崖城地標！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！正好也差不多玩膩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暢想的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的方案來點不一樣的！聽說是雲霄飛車？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水上雲霄飛車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暢想的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋轉水上雲霄飛車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彈射旋轉水上雲霄飛車！附帶超級水炮！再附帶自走車專用賽道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具體的設計方案，之後會由我和斯第奇分別提交，到時候會再次召集大家對方案進行表決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個斯第奇？住在方盒子裡的斯第奇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暢想的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，幾年前我看過他的設計，雖然玩起來沒有那麼盡興，但也有一種獨特的美......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許也可以開發玩法，畢竟那裡說白了就是場所，而重要的是在場所裡幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暢想的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總感覺斯第奇的建築會適合躺在那裡放空——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歡呼的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《奇談怪論》裡介紹過的超放鬆高盧冥想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暢想的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，事情似乎順利解決？雖然我們好像什麼都沒幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是經歷了一些艱苦卓絕的談判的。對吧，克羅綺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶奇老頭！快點喝！你在杯子裡養鱗呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳！我、我歇口氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們幹了很多事呀，嘉維爾！我們一起買了一大堆東西，度過了一個不錯的假期，還幫阿卡胡拉攬下了個大項目呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還把我的心情搞得很糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，我還以為我們的交情已經變好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，比想像的輕鬆點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明你這小鬼本來也辦得到的，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，接下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，你這副表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些日子沒動手了，有點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，沒事，我只是需要重新熱身而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我重新找回狀態，一定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
